OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Frain, the rain occasionally heavy.
OL,7,FDrier and brighter spells developing
OL,8,Fin the west during this afternoon.
OL,9,FWinds will be light from the west or
OL,10,Fsouthwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FOutbreaks of rain possible
OL,13,Facross Belfast and the east, the rain
OL,14,Fsoon moving into the Irish Sea. Clear
OL,15,Fspells developing and winds mainly
OL,16,Flight and rather chilly by dawn.
OL,17,
OL,18,CThursday:FEarly bright or sunny
OL,19,Fspells, but cloud building with a
OL,20,Fscattering of showers. Drier and
OL,21,Fbrighter again later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
