OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FBright
OL,6,Fspells and occasional heavy showers on
OL,7,FFriday. The showers lighter and well
OL,8,Fscattered on Saturday and Sunday with
OL,9,Fmore in the way of sunshine.
